# Frontend Environment Variables
# In development, Vite falls back to http://localhost:5000/api if unset.
# For production deployment (e.g. Vercel/Netlify), set this to your deployed backend API URL:
# e.g., VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://your-app-backend.onrender.com/api
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
